## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to design real-time data quality and drift detection at scale, balancing schema evolution, validation, quarantine, alerting, and cross-account governance using AWS services.

## Key Concepts
- Schema evolution and registry management
- Real-time validation and data quarantining
- Observability: CloudWatch metrics and SNS alerts
- Cross-account auditability via Glue Data Catalog and Lake Formation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo validator for a streaming record
function isRecordValid(r){
  if(!r.user_id || !r.timestamp) return false;
  if(typeof r.value !== 'number' || r.value < 0) return false;
  return true;
}
```

